# Phase 5 transcript research: an edit of a file whose text holds an ESC[2J
# and a C1 U+009B (9db199e4). The inline diff, then Ctrl-O over it: c1db919
# is expected to exit (AnsiBandOverflow); v0.0.16 shows the bytes as text.
# xfx's `edit_file` refuses a file it has not read in full, so its turns read
# `ctl.txt` first (added by T-U6), and `xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo`
# matches fx's mode.
fx: gateway p5-transcript-diffctl-turns.json
xfx: gateway p5-transcript-diffctl-xfx.json
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
work p5-transcript-ws
keep
wait 4
type edit the file
wait 1
key Enter
wait 4
snap edited
snapfull edited
key C-o
wait 2
snap full
key C-o
wait 1
snap closed
gwlog
